    {
      "version": "1.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1 adds 6- and 7- letter word gameplay, in addition to the 5-letter words already included. There are now over 15,000 words to guess in the curated Wordlets dictionary of 5-, 6-, and 7-letter words.\nVersion 1.1 gives players an unlimited number of tries to guess the word.  Players can use statistics to track the efficiency of their guesses.\nVersion 1.1 adds individual player statistics on the number of games played and the average number of tries to guess 5-, 6- and 7-letter games.\nVersion 1.1 adds a colorblind mode, changing green blocks to blue for those with green color blindness.\n",
